 \__,_| /_/\_\ |_| |_| |_| | .__/  | .__/  XMPP Utilities The UNIX Way
-------------------------- |_| --- |_| -----------------------------------
==========================================================================

Uxmpp consists of a set of tools for querying, testing, configuring, 
troubleshooting, and generally using XMPP services in a way that fits with
other basic tools on a given UNIX system.


CHANGELOG
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Version 0.0.2
- Add basic xmpp "bot" currently via mucbot command.  FIFOs are created
  and can be used to interact with a given MUC.
- Many other small changes.

Version 0.0.1 - Initial Commit
- Frame in project, and implement a basic disco request
